{{!-- "What a packing day looks like": a real sequence, so the steps are numbered.
     Every step and photo comes from SBF's event posts. --}}
<section class="packing-day" aria-labelledby="packing-day-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <div class="stack">
                <p class="t-eyebrow eyebrow-chicago">Once a month &middot; National India Hub, Schaumburg</p>
                <h2 class="t-h1" id="packing-day-title">What a packing day looks like</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="packing-facts t-small"><span>2 volunteer hours</span><span>4 hours for youth leads</span><span>Students, families and groups</span></p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps day-steps" role="list">
            <li class="step">
                <img src="{{@site.url}}/content/images/size/w720/2026/09/IMG_6238.JPEG" alt="Two youth leaders giving an orientation in front of a screen" loading="lazy">
                <p class="t-eyebrow">Step 1</p>
                <h3 class="t-h3">Youth leaders kick it off</h3>
                <p>Student youth leaders run each event. In September, Aanya Mehta and Bryce Batterton opened with an orientation.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step">
                <img src="{{@site.url}}/content/images/size/w720/2026/02/IMG_3862-1.jpeg" alt="Volunteers of all ages making peanut butter and jelly sandwiches at a long table" loading="lazy">
                <p class="t-eyebrow">Step 2</p>
                <h3 class="t-h3">Make sandwiches</h3>
                <p>Peanut butter and jelly, assembly-line style, hundreds at a time.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step">
                <img src="{{@site.url}}/content/images/size/w720/2026/09/IMG_6241.JPEG" alt="Volunteers filling brown paper bags with snacks" loading="lazy">
                <p class="t-eyebrow">Step 3</p>
                <h3 class="t-h3">Pack the bags</h3>
                <p>Brown bags with a sandwich, chips and a granola bar, plus weekend meal bags for students.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step">
                <img src="{{@site.url}}/content/images/size/w720/2026/04/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-18-at-8.30.08-AM.jpeg" alt="Two students wheeling boxes of packed bags into a school" loading="lazy">
                <p class="t-eyebrow">Step 4</p>
                <h3 class="t-h3">Deliver</h3>
                <p>Partners pick up, and our team drops bags at shelters and high schools.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>
